  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation Masterplan on Food Safety Management in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam faces difficulties in assuring the safety of its food chain. A national food safety control system is lacking. The Vietnamese government is willing to improve the situation and has developed a master plan to improve its food safety control system. This project aims to improve the governmental reference laboratory structure for food safety in Vietnam by drafting an implementation plan. By improving the capacity and abilities of food safety laboratories in Vietnam, reference laboratories will be better equipped to conduct their supervisory duties.</narrative>
  </description>
